  "finding": "The share-only joint fit recovers amplitude and position for amplitudes below about 50 um, and fails above it: the share saturates (1.000 on the 100/200 um runs) so the two parameters stop being identifiable, and multi-start then finds lower-cost but worse answers, which is evidence of model misspecification rather than of a better fit.  Round 260's pointwise assembly managed 0/3; this forward fit manages 5/9 from the nominal start and 4/9 from multi-start."
}
